<description>&lt;p&gt;A roof collapse in a school in Peshawar killed dozens of pupils and a teacher, with casualty numbers ranging from 27 to 34 children across reports. The Taliban and Russia are drawing closer, a development noted in regional analysis. Pakistan has imposed emergency rule in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, heightening tensions with Afghanistan. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNVFBPejNBWTJhLUVSVnBOUm5XM0xzX2drLVowNXFzRDFHS3dDN3l3M1llVndpdkRyNUtyU2RJUmo4RlhsampOOVVSOHNLeEw1T0N2QUlFUTlOWjd0RXFBUjZkN0E1aHhSU3lueC1oenJ5cTBVamo1U291MVcyYXo1aWo1SEgxeW1BZzByZy15WldfWXczQ3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPRDRuNjhwX0FtSUZWN1FwSGx0NVRFeDhBUWJWYTBNX3BOR3EtMDBDUDlEeE8xNEZJSm93MzN5bWEtVll3aXpMY21vSWxqdkQ4WFVfZHVTOEdVRmt1YnlRX0I0bHFFWkY2VmJCWUxvekhHUkJqMnotTmRvdS1YNmRiRGpBVlpNZXdJN2VkUkMtY3dibFFYbmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE83bEFwbS0za0dIT0c3VS1wdk1QMlhmemVfUTNEUWtWaGwyTlY4N2RPTG9jdlpJNVFkQnJmTWM2Y3hmMUhZWERXYjB3cFpFc0FaS2s0NDNPU25pdkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNUkRqVmxlcEZqVWsxUFB2UXZyQWx6Ukw0TmR5a1Zkbzl1SVE0Z1VvLWJXa05FeU4tbGl1RmVDZmd5OGZ3ZWFFMHdZRWlRelpUXzRrcFZpbzlmaVZUeVZOYzh0MkUtX0R5NEhrTUVWWU0wc2l5WGZtM2ZYOERWUVdGZXJRN3M2dmZRWXBvOXBpRXlDbzNaVUxicXhCYzFrSjktVzJNUjdRaE5iNFFESFVUM3V1UzNkd1JjdjFrMm